# B5: the contract `PreU6`

`preU6_holds`: for every plan and every table, `PreU6 P pl tab` holds. The family `U` has four
procedures, the native pairs `eCn / tearP` (chunk pass) and `eJn / tearP` (`J` pass), relocated
by the permutation of `nativeLayout`; `Cp = 2`, `A = 0`. Hence `PreNeed6 P pl` (`preNeed6_holds`).
-/

